  "releaseNotes": "- Added `ManiaPlanetChannelRecordAPI` for channel map leaderboards and player records, and `ManiaPlanetChannelFeedbackAPI` for vote and rating totals\n- Added public JSON converters and access to `ManiaPlanetAPIHandler.Authorization` and `Payload` for external serialization and player tokens\n- Fixed concurrent authorization for clients sharing a handler, OAuth scope encoding, and escaping of map and title IDs\n- Updated the User-Agent to report the installed package version\n- Added .NET 11 support",
